# Official BPM peri accumulates N/m^3: convert to nodal N BEFORE external forces.
variable si_fx atom fx*d_vfrac
variable si_fy atom fy*d_vfrac
variable si_fz atom fz*d_vfrac
fix si_force all setforce v_si_fx v_si_fy v_si_fz
velocity all set 0 0 0 units box
group driven id 90
group free subtract all driven
variable zero equal 0
variable disp equal 1.5000000000000012e-05*0.5*(1-cos(PI*min(time/1.0000000000000001e-05,1)))
variable speed equal (time<1.0000000000000001e-05)*1.5000000000000012e-05*PI/(2*1.0000000000000001e-05)*sin(PI*min(time/1.0000000000000001e-05,1))
fix drive driven move variable v_disp v_zero v_zero v_speed v_zero v_zero units box
fix integrate free nve
fix half_read all external pf/callback 1 1
fix full_read all audit/readonly/finalv3
thermo_style custom step time atoms bonds ke pe
thermo_modify flush yes
run 100
